      en: "Located in the vibrant landscape of Trinidad, tt-cedros-cities-v2 serves as an essential site for understanding the island history and regional development. It provides students with a deeper appreciation of the complex cultural and geographical dynamics that shape the nation. Geography K8 â€” landscape and cultural heritage."
