      en: "The site tt-tableland-cities-v2 is a testament to the diverse ecological and historical layers that comprise the island of Trinidad. This area offers a unique perspective for students studying the intersection of natural resources and colonial legacy in the Caribbean. Sachkunde K5 â€” ecosystems and human geography."
